    "outro-retro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · NEXT</small><strong>SPX · disagreement retrospective</strong><p>Freeze history, trace the first branch, and version one repair. Next: S1E20 · build a review cadence that compounds.</p></div></div>`,
    "outro-cadence": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · NEXT</small><strong>TRADINGFLOW · review cadence</strong><p>Trigger the packet, match review depth, assign the repair, and carry versions forward. Next: S1E21 · publish a season review without a scorecard.</p></div></div>`,
    "outro-season-review": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 1 COMPLETE</small><strong>Method review · clean handoff</strong><p>Carry the packet, cadence, and boundaries forward. Next: S2E01 · start a new season with a new hypothesis.</p></div></div>`,
    "s2e01-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E01</small><strong>Question first · scope fixed</strong><p>Next: S2E02 · turn the hypothesis into a replay recipe without changing the question.</p></div></div>`,
    "s2e02-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E02</small><strong>Recipe fixed · result still open</strong><p>Next: S2E03 · replay the recipe across sessions without changing the question.</p></div></div>`,
    "s2e03-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E03</small><strong>Same recipe · new session</strong><p>Next: S2E04 · build a replay cohort without blending different recipes.</p></div></div>`,
    "s2e04-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E04</small><strong>Cohort built · boundary visible</strong><p>Next: S2E05 · write a cohort report another analyst can inspect and challenge.</p></div></div>`,
