    "s2e06-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E06</small><strong>Prior result hidden · method exposed</strong><p>Next: S2E07 · compare analyst reads without forcing agreement.</p></div></div>`,
    "s2e07-outro": `<div class="outro-card"><div class="outro-mark">TF</div><div><small>TRADINGFLOW ACADEMY · SEASON 2 · S2E07</small><strong>Shared packet · disagreement useful</strong><p>Next: S2E08 · calibrate the read without collapsing uncertainty into yes or no.</p></div></div>`,
